			"New item added to your collection log: Pet snakeling").isEmpty());
		JsonObject e = only(ticks(3), "pet");
		Assert.assertEquals("[\"Pet snakeling\"]", e.getAsJsonArray("names").toString());
		Assert.assertFalse(e.has("duplicate"));
	}

